{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929","id":"msg_bdrk_01QH2GTUN7GM3CCkQUNw2EdZ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I need to calculate 17 × 23. Let me break this down step by step.\n\nI'll use the distributive property to make this easier:\n17 × 23 = 17 × (20 + 3)\n       = (17 × 20) + (17 × 3)\n\nFirst, let me calculate 17 × 20:\n17 × 20 = 17 × 2 × 10\n        = 34 × 10\n        = 340\n\nNext, let me calculate 17 × 3:\n17 × 3 = 51\n\nNow I add them together:\n340 + 51 = 391\n\nLet me verify this with another method - the standard multiplication:\n    23\n  × 17\n  ----\n   161  (23 × 7)\n  230   (23 × 10)\n  ----\n  391\n\nYes, 17 × 23 = 391","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"# Calculating 17 × 23\n\nI'll break this down using the distributive property:\n\n## Step 1: Break down 23\n23 = 20 + 3\n\nSo: 17 × 23 = 17 × (20 + 3)\n\n## Step 2: Distribute the multiplication\n17 × (20 + 3) = (17 × 20) + (17 × 3)\n\n## Step 3: Calculate each part\n**17 × 20:**\n- 17 × 2 = 34\n- 34 × 10 = 340\n\n**17 × 3:**\n- 17 × 3 = 51\n\n## Step 4: Add the results\n340 + 51 = **391**\n\n**Answer: 17 × 23 = 391**"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":55,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":429,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":228}}}